essary residue. No other unnecessary mutation is evident.","evidence_ids":["cmd-7432ff3b55b3443b","cmd-724f5a37581448e2","cmd-640712b559704c69","cmd-87d9004da4584075","cmd-1197a23b44d3470a","cmd-765eb908c0284edc","global:after_executor:node1:temporary-files","global:after_executor:node1:failed-services","global:after_executor:node1:listening-sockets"]},"overall_summary":"Both material outcomes are satisfied with direct pre-reboot, disruption, and post-reboot evidence. The provider-wide node-restart protocol is also substantially complete for the sole managed node: it includes a healthy pre-state, restart acknowledgement, independently corroborated boot-ID change, and recovered service and data state.","limitations":["Native package-health collection timed out both before and after execution, so package consistency could not be independently assessed.","The retained /tmp/secure-volume-reboot.log was inventoried but its contents and size were not captured."]}
